@page "/when-the-storm-hits"
<PageTitle>When the storm hits · Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <h1 class="ta-page-headline">When the storm hits</h1>
    <p class="ta-storm-idea">Turn it down. Don’t switch it off.</p>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">Sooner or later, everyone needs cash: a new roof, a lost job, a market that keeps you up at night. Tangent Atlas makes it easy to raise. Turn the dial down a few degrees and every holding in every account comes down together. Your mix stays your mix, and your favorites keep their place.</p>
</div>

<section class="ta-storm-band">
    <div class="ta-container ta-storm-grid">
        <div class="ta-storm-dial">
            <svg width="240" height="240" viewBox="0 0 240 240" role="img" aria-label="A round thermostat turned down from 100% invested to 80% invested">
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="112" fill="#ffffff" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.12)" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="433.5 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="346.8 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="70" fill="#f9f9f7"></circle>
                <text x="120" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Playfair Display, Georgia, serif" font-size="44" fill="#1a1a1a">80%</text>
                <text x="120" y="148" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#4b5563">invested</text>
                <text x="120" y="168" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="500" fill="#0F6E56">▼ from 100%</text>
            </svg>
            <div class="ta-storm-dial-caption">You set the temperature.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-storm-bars">
            <div class="ta-storm-row">
                <div class="ta-storm-label">Before: $500,000 invested</div>
                <div class="ta-storm-bar" role="img" aria-label="Before: your favorite $150,000, your second favorite $100,000, an index fund $200,000, everything else $50,000">
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-1" style="width: 30%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Favorite</span>$150k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-2" style="width: 20%"><span class="ta-seg-name">2nd favorite</span>$100k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-3" style="width: 40%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Index fund</span>$200k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-4" style="width: 10%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Other</span>$50k</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ta-storm-row">
                <div class="ta-storm-label">After: $400,000 invested, $100,000 in cash</div>
                <div class="ta-storm-bar" role="img" aria-label="After: every holding 20% smaller, the same mix, and $100,000 in cash">
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-1" style="width: 24%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Favorite</span>$120k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-2" style="width: 16%"><span class="ta-seg-name">2nd favorite</span>$80k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-3" style="width: 32%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Index fund</span>$160k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-4" style="width: 8%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Other</span>$40k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-cash" style="width: 20%"><span class="ta-seg-name">Cash</span>$100k</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="ta-storm-note">When you sell blindly, your mix drifts. Here the whole house cools together: every holding is 20% smaller, and the mix is exactly what it was.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <div class="ta-storm-adjust">
        <h2 class="ta-storm-adjust-title">Don’t change your plan. Adjust it.</h2>
        <p class="ta-page-sub">Getting back into your positions is as easy as getting out. Just turn the dial back up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ta-storm-final">
        <p class="ta-storm-close">Respond with discipline, not panic.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</div>
